```js
function kaunter() {
  let n = 0;
  return () => ++n;
}
const c = kaunter();
console.log(c(), c()); // 1 2
```
The inner function keeps `n` alive after `kaunter` returns — true privacy without classes. Classic leak source: closures capturing big objects in long-lived handlers.

```js
const { nama, umur = 0 } = pengguna;
const [pertama, ...lain] = senarai;
const salin = { ...asal, umur: 21 };
```
Destructure function params for self-documenting signatures; spread copies shallowly (nested objects still shared — use structuredClone for deep). Rest collects leftovers in both arrays and objects.

```js
// util.js
export const tambah = (a, b) => a + b;
export default function utama() {}
// guna:
import utama, { tambah } from "./util.js";
```
Named exports refactor safely (IDE renames all sites) and tree-shake; default exports hide names. Prefer named; one default per module max, and always include the `.js` extension in ESM import paths.

```js
const r = await fetch("/api/sihat", { signal: AbortSignal.timeout(8000) });
if (!r.ok) throw new Error(`HTTP ${r.status}`);
const data = await r.json();
```
Fetch hanya reject pada ralat rangkaian — semak `r.ok` sendiri. `AbortSignal.timeout()` elak gantung selamanya; balut dalam try/catch di sempadan panggilan.

```js
const salin = structuredClone(asal);
const teks = JSON.stringify(obj, null, 2);
```
`structuredClone` klon dalam sebenar (Date, Map, Set) — ganti helah JSON yang rosakkan jenis khas. `JSON.stringify` untuk siri/log; tangani rujukan membulat yang kedua-duanya tolak.

```js
const esok = new Date(Date.now() + 86400000);
new Intl.DateTimeFormat("ms-MY", { dateStyle: "full" }).format(esok);
```
Simpan/angkut sebagai ISO UTC (`toISOString()`), papar via `Intl` mengikut locale. Aritmetik tarikh manual (bulan 0-indeks, DST) penuh perangkap — library (date-fns) untuk logik kompleks.

```js
try { JSON.parse(raw); } catch { polisLalai(); }
throw new Error("gagal simpan", { cause: ralatAsal });
```
Abaikan parameter catch jika tidak guna; `cause` rantai ralat (asalek-usul kekal dalam surihan). Jangan telan senyap — log atau balut semula dengan konteks.

